// Page Intro Text :
"P1255567872" "{HeroName}, right? My name's <color yellow>Matthew Habashy.</color> I'm with the Federal Bureau of Super Powered Affairs, or the <color yellow>FBSA</color>.<br><br>Are you OK from getting out of Galaxy City?<br><br>I just... barely got out myself."
// Answer Text :
"P2877866649" "Don't worry about me. What's the situation here?"
// Answer Text :
"P2351832913" "I am, but what are we doing to recover it?"
// Page Situation Text :
"P2394512754" "<color yellow>Longbow</color> and the <color yellow>Paragon Police Department</color> have devoted all their resources towards containing the situation.<br><br>However... that's left Atlas Park nearly defenseless against <i>other</i> crimes."
// Answer Text :
"P3936346721" "What's the situation in Atlas?"
// Page Recover Text :
"P2719715016" "Atlas Park has seen much better days, {HeroName}. All the refugees from Galaxy City are being sent here, either to find... loved ones that they lost, or for support.<br><br>However, the majority of the police force is fighting in Galaxy City, leaving Atlas ripe for the picking.<br><br>That's why the FBSA sent me down here, to work with heroes like you to try to take back Atlas Park. Are you ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P4124785633" "Let's do this."
// Page Recover2 Text :
"P4000010018" "Atlas Park has seen much better days, {HeroName}. All the refugees from Galaxy City are being sent here, either to find... loved ones that they lost, or for support.<br><br>However, with the majority of the police force fighting in Galaxy City, Atlas is ripe for the picking.<br><br>That's why the FBSA sent me down here, to work with heroes like you to try to take back Atlas Park. Are you ready?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NuminaStore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AccountServerDown Text :
"P1128815568" "Galaxy City is an absolute mess, {HeroName}. The Shivans, they seem to be getting more powerful by the minute.<br><br>Unfortunately, it appears Atlas Park is having a ton of problems of its own.<br><br>The rest of us will do what we can to stabilize the situation here. You need to go help the people of Atlas Park!"
// Answer Text :
"P2151674550" "Alright, I'll handle Atlas Park."
// Page TeleportPage Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Page DidntBuyProduct Text :
"P1385537668" "Good to see you made it back, {HeroName}. Galaxy City is an absolute mess. These Shivans, they seem to be getting more powerful by the minute.<br><br>Unfortunately, it looks like Atlas Park is having a ton of problems of its own. We need you to get to Atlas and help them out!<br><br>You'll need to understand how the <color yellow>Paragon Market</color> works before leaving, however; it has a ton of items that can help you with fighting crime in Atlas Park! Claim the <color yellow>FREE New Player Pack and Knowledgeable badge by clicking on the icon below</color>, then speak with me again.<br><br><span align=center><a href='cmd:web_store_open_product ctsyknow'><img src=icon_ig_storeaccess_color_full.tga></a><br>Shop</span><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>You can visit the Market at any time by clicking on this icon on your main screen.</color></span>"
// Answer Text :
"P3029899418" "(Claim the FREE New Player Pack now)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NuminaStore2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AccountServerDown Text :
"P2438759847" "Good work, {HeroName}. The rest of us will do what we can to stabilize the situation here. You need to go help the people of Atlas Park!"
// Page BoughtProduct Text :
"P947667187" "Good work, {HeroName}.<br><br>The rest of us will do what we can to stabilize the situation here. You need to go help the people of Atlas Park. Before you do that, I can show you how to claim items that you've purchased from the Paragon Market."
// Answer Text :
"P154229843" "(View the item claim tutorial)"
// Answer Text :
"P3640441879" "(Go to Atlas Park)"
// Page ItemClaim1 Text :
"P1912096159" "Click on the <color yellow>Email</color> button on your chat window.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail1.tga><br><br>Then, click on <color yellow>Character items</color><br><img src=NPopHelpEmail2.tga><br><br>Click on the item you wish to claim, then hit the claim button.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail3.tga>"
// Answer Text :
"P3273531036" "(View how to use temporary powers)"
// Page ItemClaim2 Text :
"P1640985801" "Click on the <color yellow>Powers</color> button on your powers bar window.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail4.tga><br><br>Then, click on the power you want to add to your power bar.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail5.tga>"
// Page TimerNotFinishedPage Text :
"P1624244313" "You need to understand how the <color yellow>Paragon Market</color> works before leaving; it has a ton of items that can help you with fighting crime in Atlas Park!  Claim the <color yellow>FREE New Player Pack and Knowledgeable badge by clicking on the icon below</color>, then speak with me again.<br><br><br><br><br><br><span align=center><a href='cmd:web_store_open_product ctsyknow'><img src=icon_ig_storeaccess_color_full.tga></a><br>Shop</span><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>You can visit the Market at any time by clicking on this icon on your main screen.</color></span>"
// Answer Text :
"P3330498022" "I'm ready to move forward, I'll look at the store later."
// Page MoveForward Text :
"P2660527696" "Alright, {HeroName}. Unfortunately, it seems like Atlas Park has a ton of problems right now.<br><br>The rest of us will do what we can to stabilize the situation here. You need to go help the people of Atlas Park!."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

